        "title": "Equality Check",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145325,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a player's health is less than or equal to a number, we use the <strong>less-than-or-equal-to operator</strong>, <code>&lt;=</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145326,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If the number on the left is less than or equal to the number on the right, like in <code>11 &lt;= 11</code>, the result is <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>11</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145327,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a score is greater than or equal to another number, we use the <strong>greater-than-or-equal-to operator</strong>, <code>&gt;=</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"3099\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3099\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145328,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To store the result of a comparison in a variable, we use the <code>=</code> sign. This is the <strong>assignment operator</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145329,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can also use a comparison operator to compare a variable with another variable, like in <code>min &lt;= max</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" min = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" max = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = min &lt;= max;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>min</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>max</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which operator checks if a value is less than or equal to another value?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>&lt;=</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>&gt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145331,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does the greater-than-or-equal-to operator, <code>&gt;=</code>, do?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">It checks if a value is greater than or equal to another value</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">It checks if a value is greater than another value</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It checks if a value is greater than or equal to another value.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which operator do we use to check if a score on the left side of the statement is equal to or greater than <code>21</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&gt;=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145333,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145334,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if <code>playerHealth</code> is less than or equal to <code>20</code> with the less-than-or-equal-to operator, <code>&lt;=</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lowHealth = playerHealth &lt;= \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Low health: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + lowHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145335,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Store the result of <code>score &gt;= 10</code> in the <code>unlockedLevelTwo</code> variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" unlockedLevelTwo = score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level 2 unlocked: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + unlockedLevelTwo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145336,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if <code>enemiesDefeated</code> is less than or equal to <code>minimumNeeded</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"109\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemiesDefeated = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minimumNeeded = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" didNotMeetGoal = enemiesDefeated &lt;= minimumNeeded;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(didNotMeetGoal);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>enemiesDefeated</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>minimumNeeded</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
